1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,533
这块表没有电池。
This watch has no battery.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,286
可它一天只差几秒。
Yet it drifts only a few seconds a day.

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:11,423
打开看，三套系统在分工。
Open it up, and three systems share the work.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,628
上紧的发条存着动力。
A wound spring stores the power.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:19,556
一串齿轮把它传下去，一级比一级快。
A train of gears passes it on, faster at every step.

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:24,850
在这台教学机芯里，快了 4800 倍。
In this teaching movement, 4,800 times faster.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,406
不加约束，发条会一口气泄光。
Left alone, the spring would empty in a single rush.

8
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:33,987
所以擒纵机构每次只放过半个齿。
So the escapement lets it out, half a tooth at a time.

9
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:39,125
摆轮来回摆，每秒五拍。
The balance swings back and forth, five beats every second.

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,183
每一拍，就是一声滴答。
Each beat is one tick.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,715
发条、齿轮、摆轮：表就是这样走时的。
Spring, gears, balance. That is how it keeps time.
